  m_Name: 1Blessings of Amun-Ra0
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::TalentDefinition
  id: 1
  displayName: Blessings of Amun-Ra
  description: 'Tutankhamun gets blessed by the god he invested the most elemental
    stats into at the beginning of battle.


    Fire - Ra: Ra deals fire damage
    to a random enemy equal to Tutankhamun''s fire attack at the end of each turn.


    Ice
    - Ptah: Enemies brought to half-health by Tutankhamun are entombed in a frozen
    pyramid by Ptah, becoming unable to act and immune to skills for one turn.


    Storm
    - Set: At the start of every turn Set increases the a random elemental resistance
    substat of a random ally by Tutankhamun''s storm defense stat.


    Acid - Osiris:
    If Tutankhamun takes lethal damage, Osiris protects him, letting him survive
    with 1 health.


    Blood - Sekhmet: Sekhmet converts all of Tutankhamun''s
    physical damage skills to blood damage and causes these skills to inflict bleed
    on enemies hit.


    Psychic - Aten: Aten applies ten stacks of burn to Tutankhamun.
    The next two strongest gods come to your aid, granting you their blessings.'
